Following incubation, 20 µL from each well was plated onto Mueller–Hinton agar for bacteria or Sabouraud dextrose agar for yeasts and incubated at 37 °C for 24 h. Colonies were counted, and inhibition percentages were calculated using the following formula:\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
